AROO SI HAI.  VIVAH REKHA FEEKI HOKAR SLOPING HAI.  LEFT HAND ME LINES SAAF, SEEDHI AUR NORMAL HAIN.  ','',1,1,'2026-09-13 00:04:46',NULL);
