 WIFE SUNITA - HARMONIOUS. |CHILDREN: 2 SONS  |MOTHER: PREM LATA, 6-AUG-1980 KO MATA KA VIVAH HUA. LAGBHAG 2000 SE THYROID HAI. 19-FEB-2015 KO PILES KI SURGERY KE LIYE ADMIT HONA THA, MERE PAS AA GAYI. MANSA DEVI YATRA BATAI, SURGERY TAL GAYI.   VISIT 19-JAN-2017, DUBARA PILES KI SURGERY KI NAUBAT HAI, KAYA KIYA JAYE?  AUSTRALIA NOONH KI DELIVERY KARVANE GAYI THI, 29/5/2016 KO HBP KA PATA CHALA. MEDICINE SE PET KHARAB HUA. ACHANAK PILES KA BLOOD AAYA. GALTI SE MEDICINE ZAYADA LE LI, PET KA KABADA HO GAYA.  |FATHER: SABZI MANDI KA ADHATI HAI, KHANDANI ZAMIN BAHUT THI. JUARI HONE SE SAB KUCH LUTA DIYA HAI, LUTA RAHA HAI. GHAR-GHAT KI KOI FIKAR NAHI  |MISC: BIRTH TIME SHAKKI HAI. 11HR TO 13 HR HAI. ISKI MASI NE BATAYA KE 12.45 HR HAI.  ELDER BROTHER RAVI KANT IN MELB.AUSTRALIA AS PR, HIS WIFE IS JYOTI FROM BELOW AVERAGE FAMILY PARENTS BAHUT DUKHI HAIN','',0,0,'2026-09-13 00:04:50',NULL);
